  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 8.1.5:\n\n## Added\n- Method GetTemplateTagInfos added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Templates.DataTemplate: Gets the list of TemplateTagInfo objects in the document. (DOC-6906)\n- Enum TemplateTagType added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Templates: Specifies the type of a template tag. (DOC-6906)\n- Class TemplateTagInfo added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Templates: Represents information about a template tag. (DOC-6906)\n- Property MarkTemplateTagAreas added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Layout.DocumentPaginator: Indicates whether to mark the locations of named template tags during the layout process. (DOC-6906)\n- Class TemplateTagAreas added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Layout: Represents the locations of a template tag on a page. (DOC-6906)\n- Delegate MarkupTemplateTagsDelegate added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Layout: Defines a method that adds custom markup to template tags that appear on a PDF page. (DOC-6906)\n- Property MarkupTemplateTags added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Layout.PdfOutputSettings: Specifies a method to be executed for each PDF page during export, allowing custom markup to be added to template tags on the page. (DOC-6906)\n- Class ToaFieldOptions added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Fields: Represents options for configuring a Table of Authorities (TOA) field. (DOC-6247)\n- Class ToaPageNumberOptions added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Fields: Represents options that control how page numbers are displayed in the result of a Table of Authorities (TOA) field. (DOC-6247)\n- Class CitationCategoryMap added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Fields: Represents a mapping of category names for TA (Table of Authorities Entry) and TOA (Table of Authorities) fields. (DOC-6247)\n- Class TaFieldOptions added to GrapeCity.Documents.Word.Fields: Represents options for configuring a TA (Table of Authorities) field. (DOC-6247)\n\n## Changed\n- Property Hyphenation in GrapeCity.Documents.Word.ParagraphFormat is now obsolete. Use SuppressAutoHyphens instead. (DOC-7003)\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where loading and saving a document using GrapeCity.Documents.Word.GcWordDocument could alter the indentation of some elements if certain rarely used formatting properties were present. (DOC-6935)",
